  noneSprite: {fileID: 0}
  protectorDetails:
  - Munimen Sanitas - Protector has more Health and Stamina.
  - (1) Salus Brevis - Give nearby characters temporary health.
  - (2) Audacia Mortalis - Taunts nearby enemy.
  occultistDetails:
  - Spectaculum Tenebris - Occultist can see the demon through walls at regular intervals.
  - (1) Auget Agilitas - Increases Movement Speed of Allies.
  - (2) Sanatio Tenebris - Restores Health To Allies.
  drifterDetails:
  - Fuga Velox - Drifter has higher movement speed.
  - (1) Umbra Fugitiva - Become invisible.
  - (2) Aethereus Vinculum - Bind yourself and the enemy for a brief period.
  trapperDetails:
  - Munera Venandi - Trapper can interact with unique collectibles to charge his
    abilities.
  - (1) Hibernus Impedimentum - Throw a slowing grenade.
  - (2) Gelu Immobilis - Place a trap that freezes the enemy for a few seconds.
  classDetails:
  - {fileID: 1004669311}
  - {fileID: 694763690}
  - {fileID: 543354336}
